## PDF / Document Input

`DocumentBlockParam` 接受一个 `DocumentBlockParamSource` union：`Base64PdfSource` / `UrlPdfSource` / `PlainTextSource` / `ContentBlockSource`。`Base64PdfSource` 会自动设置 `MediaType = "application/pdf"` 和 `Type = "base64"`。

```csharp
new MessageParam {
    Role = Role.User,
    Content = new List<ContentBlockParam> {
        new DocumentBlockParam { Source = new Base64PdfSource { Data = base64String } },
        new TextBlockParam { Text = "Summarize this PDF" },
    },
}
```

